---
const gallery = [
  {
    src: "/images/gallery-1.jpg",
    alt: "Penyerahan sertifikat dan kunci akad notaris rumah TerAs Bahagia"
  },
  {
    src: "/images/gallery-2.jpg",
    alt: "Deretan rumah Modern American Style di kawasan mandiri TerAs Bahagia Serang"
  },
  {
    src: "/images/gallery-3.jpg",
    alt: "Halaman belakang luas rumah Tipe 30/72 dengan privasi tembok tertutup"
  },
  {
    src: "/images/gallery-4.jpg",
    alt: "Konsultasi denah dan pemilihan kavling di galeri pemasaran TerAs Bahagia"
  }
];
---

<section class="bg-surface-container-low py-20 border-b border-outline-variant/40">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="reveal text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm mb-3 font-semibold">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">reviews</span>
        TESTIMONI PEMBELI
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-primary mb-3">
        Mereka Sudah Berhenti Mengontrak. Sekarang Giliran Anda.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant font-body-md">
        Cerita nyata pembeli yang telah membuktikan kemudahan proses kepemilikan di TerAs Bahagia.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Testimonial Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div class="reveal delay-100 card-interactive bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl p-6 border border-outline-variant shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex text-amber-500 mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            "Awalnya saya ragu karena cuma pedagang kuliner tanpa slip gaji kantor. Tapi tim legal TerAs Bahagia bantu rapikan pembukuan tabungan sampai pengajuan ke bank disetujui. Sekarang senang banget punya rumah sendiri."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/40">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-primary">
            SK
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-title-md font-title-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Surya K.</p>
            <p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-outline">Wiraswasta Kuliner (Blok B4)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
      <div class="reveal delay-200 card-interactive bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl p-6 border border-outline-variant shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex text-amber-500 mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            "Dulu bayar kontrakan di Serang Rp 950 ribu tiap bulan, rasanya sayang banget uang hilang. Di TerAs Bahagia cicilannya 1 jutaan flat, lokasinya cuma 10 menit ke kantor saya di KP3B. Pilihan paling logis untuk masa depan."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/40">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-primary">
            FR
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-title-md font-title-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Fahmi R.</p>
            <p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-outline">Staff Logistik Kawasan (Blok A2)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div class="reveal delay-300 card-interactive bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl p-6 border border-outline-variant shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex text-amber-500 mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-weight="fill">star</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            "Yang bikin kami suka adalah tanahnya 72 meter persegi. Sisa tanah belakang masih sangat luas, anak bisa leluasa main dan kami sudah dapat gratis meja dapur dan tembok belakang tertutup tanpa repot renovasi lagi."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/40">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-primary">
            DA
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-title-md font-title-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Dita & Anton</p>
            <p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-outline">Keluarga Muda (Blok C1)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 4-item Photo Gallery Row -->
    <div class="reveal delay-200 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      {gallery.map((item) => (
        <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant shadow-sm card-interactive">
          <img
            class="w-full h-36 object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
            alt={item.alt}
            src={item.src}
            width="400"
            height="250"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
